# Title: Suspicious Download from Office Domain
# ID: 00d49ed5-4491-4271-a8db-650a4ef6f8c1
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-12-27
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.resource-development, attack.t1105, attack.t1608
# Description: Detects suspicious ways to download files from Microsoft domains that are used to store attachments in Emails or OneNote documents
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine CONTAIN "https://attachment.outlook.live.net/owa/" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "https://onenoteonlinesync.onenote.com/onenoteonlinesync/")) AND (((Image="*\\curl.exe" OR Image="*\\wget.exe")) OR ((CommandLine CONTAIN "Invoke-WebRequest" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "iwr " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "curl " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "wget " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Start-BitsTransfer" OR CommandLine CONTAIN ".DownloadFile(" OR CommandLine CONTAIN ".DownloadString("))))
